//     filled by the doorway entry), so pure omission would render a HOLE
//     in a visible run exactly where the secret is — the absence itself
//     would leak. The fiction already says what belongs there: a
//     concealed door IS a wall until found. At a concealed region's
//     border NO mask applies — see the third half.
//   - THE ROOM HIDES WITH ITS DOOR, BY THE NEVER-AUTHORED YARDSTICK
